what can i do about braxton hicks/extreme back pain?

i got induced with my first & it was a failed induction so i’m not sure if what i’m feeling is braxton hicks contractions/ back contractions or if i’m feeling early labour contractions…. it’s a pain all over my lower & upper abdomen, as well as lower, upper and mid back pain. this pain is so extreme to the point we’re i’m keeled over in pain or crying. the ONLY thing that helps is a warm bath. the pain is a solid 9 and it lasts for about an hour or two each time every half hour/ hour every two hours.

 if any help or advice could be given that would be so greatly appreciated:))!! as i’m not sure what this is(this would be my second child not second pregnancy as i’ve experienced quite a few pregnancy losses in the past)
